{"id":"msg_m_ex_sakura_03","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_sakura","label":"Sakura · Nikke"},"label":"3. I was reading about hot springs that were on t…","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_sakura_02","next":"msg_m_ex_sakura_bloominsummer_01","speakers":{"sakura":"Sakura"},"icons":{"sakura":"si_c282_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_sakura_03_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_03_1","text":"I was reading about hot springs that were on the surface in ancient times.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_03_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_03_2","text":"Tell me,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_03_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_03_3","text":"do you like hot springs?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_03_4","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_03_4","text":"Very much. Nothing beats a warm dip in a hot spring.","jump":"m_ex_sakura_03_6"},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_03_5","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_03_5","text":"I do, but they're gone now, so I can't enjoy them.","jump":"m_ex_sakura_03_9"},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_03_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_03_6","text":"I feel the same way.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_03_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_03_7","text":"Soaking in a warm hot spring","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_03_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_03_8","text":"makes all my fatigue just melt away.","jump":"m_ex_sakura_03_11"},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_03_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_03_9","text":"Tell me about it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_03_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_03_10","text":"There aren't any hot springs in the Ark, either.","jump":"m_ex_sakura_03_11"},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_03_11","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_03_11","text":"What made you bring up hot springs all of a sudden?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_03_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_03_12","text":"I just told you! I was reading about them in a book, and it caught my interest.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_03_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_03_13","text":"So, I decided to divert some natural hot spring water to make my own hot spring.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_03_14","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_03_14","text":"Is that actually possible?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_03_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_03_15","text":"It sure is.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_03_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_03_16","text":"I asked my subordinates to look into whether it was feasible to make a hot spring in the courtyard.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_03_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_03_17","text":"Turns out it is, so they went ahead and made one.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_03_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_03_18","text":"The only thing is that the courtyard looks a bit bare with just the hot spring and nothing else.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_03_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_03_19","text":"If you're up for it, we could...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_03_20","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_03_20","text":"Let's do it.","jump":"m_ex_sakura_03_22"},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_03_21","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_03_21","text":"Right now?","jump":"m_ex_sakura_03_22"},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_03_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_03_22","text":"Whoa...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_03_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_03_23","text":"All right.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_03_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_03_24","text":"Sorry, it's just that I didn't expect you to agree so readily to it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_03_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_03_25","text":"I'm glad you're so enthusiastic about helping me think about","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_03_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_03_26","text":"what trees and flowers I should plant by the hot spring.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_03_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_03_27","text":"Oh, I thought you meant...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_03_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_03_28","text":"Something the matter?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_03_29","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_03_29","text":"Oh... er... nothing.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_03_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_03_30","text":"Anyway, whenever you're free,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_03_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_03_31","text":"come stop by.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_03_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_03_32","text":"I'll be expecting you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_sakura_03_33","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_sakura_03_33","text":"Got it.","jump":null}],"chat":true}